来，等她到了美国，她想方设法，几乎不让人再知道她是捷克人。人们总想以自己的生活制造媚俗，要摆脱它，得付出多少艰辛，令人绝望。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 285, "reviewId": "17408780_7DC3ujcoW", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1667885314, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "43896728", "format": "epub", "version": 1266999731, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/3/YueWen_43896728/s_YueWen_43896728.jpg", "title": "不能承受的生命之轻（米兰·昆德拉作品系列·2022版）", "author": "[法]米兰·昆德拉", "translator": "许钧", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 129, "chapterTitle": "11", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7DB9HToV0", "review": {"bookId": "43896728", "content": "牛逼", "bookVersion": 1305712876, "range": "715-798", "abstract": "但在这一刻，萨比娜仿佛看到参议员站在布拉格一个广场的主席台上。他脸上挂着微笑，与共产党国家领导人站在高高的主席台上对脚下游行队伍中同样微笑着的民众发出的微笑一模一样。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 281, "reviewId": "17408780_7DB9HToV0", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1667834211, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "43896728", "format": "epub", "version": 1266999731, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/3/YueWen_43896728/s_YueWen_43896728.jpg", "title": "不能承受的生命之轻（米兰·昆德拉作品系列·2022版）", "author": "[法]米兰·昆德拉", "translator": "许钧", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 125, "chapterTitle": "7", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7DB9CeqvC", "review": {"bookId": "43896728", "content": "政治的战场就是要夺取口号，口号就是政治战场的一个个阵地。", "bookVersion": 1305712876, "range": "757-871", "abstract": "五一节汲取的是对生命的绝对认同这一深深的源泉，游行队伍中人们发出的心照不宣的口号，并不是“共产党万岁”而是“生命万岁”。共产党政治之所以有力量，有计谋，就在于夺取了这个口号。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 280, "reviewId": "17408780_7DB9CeqvC", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1667834127, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "43896728", "format": "epub", "version": 1266999731, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/3/YueWen_43896728/s_YueWen_43896728.jpg", "title": "不能承受的生命之轻（米兰·昆德拉作品系列·2022版）", "author": "[法]米兰·昆德拉", "translator": "许钧", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 124, "chapterTitle": "6", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 2}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7DB92TvSu", "review": {"bookId": "43896728", "content": "妙啊！", "bookVersion": 1305712876, "range": "1160-1308", "abstract": "斯大林之子因粪便而献出了自己的生命，但是为粪便而死并不是一种毫无意义的死。德国人不惜牺牲生命向东方拼命扩张帝国的领土，俄国人则为向西方扩张自己的势力范围而丧生，是的，这些人为愚蠢的事情而死，他们的死才毫无意义，才没有任何价值。相反，斯大林儿子之死是在战争的普遍愚蠢之中唯一的具有形而上学意义的死。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 276, "reviewId": "17408780_7DB92TvSu", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1667833605, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "43896728", "format": "epub", "version": 1266999731, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/3/YueWen_43896728/s_YueWen_43896728.jpg", "title": "不能承受的生命之轻（米兰·昆德拉作品系列·2022版）", "author": "[法]米兰·昆德拉", "translator": "许钧", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 120, "chapterTitle": "2", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7Dzu6N91t", "review": {"bookId": "43896728", "content": "阅人无数后的返璞归真，哈哈哈哈", "bookVersion": 1305712876, "range": "1227-1317", "abstract": "笨拙伴着激情，激情伴着笨拙，托马斯感受到绝妙的刺激。他们久久地做爱。他细细察看她长满红色雀斑的脸，在上面寻找女人被绊倒在地时的惊惶神情，那无法模仿的表情刚刚将一股亢奋传入他的大脑。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 261, "reviewId": "17408780_7Dzu6N91t", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1667739301, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "43896728", "format": "epub", "version": 1266999731, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/3/YueWen_43896728/s_YueWen_43896728.jpg", "title": "不能承受的生命之轻（米兰·昆德拉作品系列·2022版）", "author": "[法]米兰·昆德拉", "translator": "许钧", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 105, "chapterTitle": "11", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 7}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7Dz5nSxAz", "review": {"bookId": "43896728", "content": "俄国人是不是天真的认为可以像当年占领捷克一样快速占领乌克兰？", "bookVersion": 1305712876, "range": "2360-2406", "abstract": "两三个月之后，俄国人决定在他们的地盘不得有言论自由，他们的军队于一夜之间占领了托马斯的祖国。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 252, "reviewId": "17408780_7Dz5nSxAz", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1667716650, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "43896728", "format": "epub", "version": 1266999731, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/3/YueWen_43896728/s_YueWen_43896728.jpg", "title": "不能承受的生命之轻（米兰·昆德拉作品系列·2022版）", "author": "[法]米兰·昆德拉", "translator": "许钧", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 96, "chapterTitle": "2", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "commentsCount": 16, "likesCount": 39}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7Dz2zznT7", "review": {"bookId": "43896728", "content": "昆德拉太细了，大写字母是担心以前的小写连笔其他医生不认识，如果是自己原来的医院，当然不用这么在意，护士会帮他解决这类小问题。", "bookVersion": 1305712876, "range": "1180-1217", "abstract": "他说着从里面口袋里掏出记事本，撕下一页，在上面写下了药名，写的是大写字母。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 247, "reviewId": "17408780_7Dz2zznT7", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1667714075, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "43896728", "format": "epub", "version": 1266999731, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://